(cf. विष्ट्) cl. 1. Ā. (Dhātup. viii, 2) वेष्टते (pf. विवेष्टे fut. वेष्टिता &c. Gr.), to wind or twist round, Sāh.;
to adhere or cling to (loc.), AV.;
to cast the skin (said of a snake), R.;
to dress, MW. :
Caus. वेष्ट॑यति, ˚ते (aor. अविवेष्टत्, or अववेष्टत्; Pass. वेष्ट्यते),
to wrap up, envelop, enclose, surround, cover, invest, beset, TBr.; Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to tie on, wrap round (a turban &c.), MBh.; Rājat.;
to cause to shrink up, ŚvetUp. :
Desid. विवेष्टिषते Gr.:
Intens. वेवेष्ट्यते, वेवेष्टि, ib.
